{"subject": "오늘은 문화제를 준비하는 우리 반 이야기예요 | 독해한입 일본어", "body": "<!-- buttondown-editor-mode: plaintext -->\n<div style=\"background:#f2f4f6;padding:16px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Noto Sans KR','Malgun Gothic','Hiragino Sans','Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;word-break:keep-all;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:16px 0 4px;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://dokhaehanip.com/assets/brand/badge-192.png\" width=\"88\" height=\"88\" alt=\"독해한입\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;border:0;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 0 12px;\"><a href=\"https://dokhaehanip.com/ja/2026-10-22/\"><img src=\"https://dokhaehanip.com/ja/2026-10-22/thumb.png\" width=\"560\" alt=\"오늘은 문화제를 준비하는 우리 반 이야기예요\"\n  style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:20px;\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;padding:22px 20px;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#8b95a1;\">10월 22일 목요일</p>\n  <h1 style=\"margin:6px 0 12px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:800;color:#191f28;\">오늘은 <span style=\"color:#3182f6;\">문화제를 준비하는 우리 반</span> 이야기예요</h1>\n  <p style=\"margin:-6px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#4e5968;\">クラスの<ruby>文化祭<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんかさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p>\n  <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;margin:0 4px 4px 0;background:#e8f3ff;color:#3182f6;\">6문장</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;margin:0 4px 4px 0;background:#f2f4f6;color:#4e5968;\">N5 위주</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;margin:0 4px 4px 0;background:#f2f4f6;color:#4e5968;\">N4 1문장</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;margin:0 4px 4px 0;background:#f2f4f6;color:#4e5968;\">약 3분</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"height:12px;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;padding:22px 20px;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#3182f6;\">STEP 1</p>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;\">오늘의 지문</h2>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">1</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\"><ruby>昨日<rp>(</rp><rt>きのう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、クラスで<span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\"><ruby>文化祭<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんかさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></span>の<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしました。</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">2</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\"><ruby>田中<rp>(</rp><rt>たなか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんは「カフェをしませんか」と<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">3</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\">みんなは「いいですね」と<span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\"><ruby>賛成<rp>(</rp><rt>さんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></span>しました。</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">4</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\"><ruby>文化祭<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんかさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\">11<ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>がつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>3<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></span>です。</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">5</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\"><ruby>毎日<rp>(</rp><rt>まいにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>授業<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>あと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\"><ruby>準備<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅんび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></span>をすることになりました。<span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px;background:#ffeeee;color:#f04452;margin-left:6px;\">N3</span></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:28px;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#8b95a1;\">6</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#191f28;\">わたしは<ruby>絵<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をかいて、<span style=\"background:#fff3c4;font-weight:600;\">メニュー</span>を<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります。</td></tr></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:18px;\"><tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" style=\"background:#3182f6;border-radius:14px;\">\n      <a href=\"https://dokhaehanip.com/ja/2026-10-22/\" style=\"display:block;padding:16px 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;\">음성 듣고 해석 쓰러 가기</a>\n    </td></tr></table>\n  <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#8b95a1;text-align:center;\">문장별 음성, 0.8배속, 모범 해석은 웹에서 볼 수 있어요.</p>\n  \n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"height:12px;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;padding:22px 20px;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#3182f6;\">STEP 2</p>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;\">주요 단어</h2>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\"><ruby>文化祭<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんかさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">학교 축제, 문화제</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\"><ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">이야기</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\"><ruby>賛成<rp>(</rp><rt>さんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">찬성</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">11<ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>がつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>3<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">11월 3일</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\"><ruby>授業<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">수업</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\"><ruby>準備<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅんび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">준비</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">メニュー</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;color:#4e5968;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f6;\">메뉴</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"height:12px;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;padding:22px 20px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#191f28;\">오늘 주제 어땠어요?</h2>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4e5968;\">오늘은 사회 분야였어요. 한 번 누르면 사이트가 열리며 기록돼요.</p>\n  <a href=\"https://dokhaehanip.com/ja/2026-10-22/?vote=up&amp;from=email#vote\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 6px 6px 0;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid #e2e6ea;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#191f28;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://dokhaehanip.com/assets/vote-up.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:-4px;margin-right:4px;border:0;\">재밌었어요</a><a href=\"https://dokhaehanip.com/ja/2026-10-22/?vote=down&amp;from=email#vote\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 6px 6px 0;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid #e2e6ea;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#191f28;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://dokhaehanip.com/assets/vote-down.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:-4px;margin-right:4px;border:0;\">별로였어요</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:16px 8px 0;font-size:13px;color:#8b95a1;text-align:center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://dokhaehanip.com/ja/archive/\" style=\"color:#4e5968;\">지난 지문 모아 보기</a>\n  <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#4e5968;\">독해한입에 바라는 점이 있으면 <a href=\"mailto:wonsang.dev@gmail.com?subject=%5B%EB%8F%85%ED%95%B4%ED%95%9C%EC%9E%85%5D%20%EA%B8%B0%EB%8A%A5%20%EA%B1%B4%EC%9D%98&amp;body=%EC%96%B4%EB%96%A4%20%EA%B8%B0%EB%8A%A5%EC%9D%B4%20%EC%9E%88%EC%9C%BC%EB%A9%B4%20%EC%A2%8B%EC%9D%84%EA%B9%8C%EC%9A%94%3F%0D%0A%0D%0A%0D%0A%EC%99%9C%20%ED%95%84%EC%9A%94%ED%95%9C%EA%B0%80%EC%9A%94%3F%20%28%EC%96%B4%EB%96%A4%20%EB%95%8C%20%EB%B6%88%ED%8E%B8%ED%96%88%EB%8A%94%EC%A7%80%29%0D%0A%0D%0A%0D%0A----%0D%0A%EB%B3%B4%EB%8D%98%20%EC%96%B8%EC%96%B4%3A%20%EC%9D%BC%EB%B3%B8%EC%96%B4\" style=\"color:#2a52d4;font-weight:600;\">기능 건의</a>, 이상한 곳을 보셨다면 <a href=\"mailto:wonsang.dev@gmail.com?subject=%5B%EB%8F%85%ED%95%B4%ED%95%9C%EC%9E%85%5D%20%EB%B2%84%EA%B7%B8%20%EC%A0%9C%EB%B3%B4&amp;body=%EB%AC%B4%EC%8A%A8%20%EC%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%20%EC%9E%88%EC%97%88%EB%82%98%EC%9A%94%3F%0D%0A%28%EC%98%88%3A%20%EC%9D%8C%EC%84%B1%EC%9D%B4%20%EC%95%88%20%EB%82%98%EC%99%80%EC%9A%94%2C%20%EA%B8%80%EC%9E%90%EA%B0%80%20%EA%B2%B9%EC%B3%90%20%EB%B3%B4%EC%97%AC%EC%9A%94%29%0D%0A%0D%0A%0D%0A----%0D%0A%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fdokhaehanip.com%2Fja%2F2026-10-22%2F%0D%0A%EA%B8%B0%EA%B8%B0%3A%20%0D%0A%ED%99%94%EB%A9%B4%20%ED%81%AC%EA%B8%B0%3A%20\" style=\"color:#2a52d4;font-weight:600;\">버그 제보</a>로 알려 주세요.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#8b95a1;\">매일 아침 JLPT N3 일본어 지문을 보내 드려요.<br>\n  수준이나 언어를 바꾸고 싶으면 <a href=\"https://dokhaehanip.com/ja/#subscribe\" style=\"color:#8b95a1;\">여기</a>에서 같은 이메일로 다시 구독해 주세요. 확인 메일 없이 바로 바뀌어요.<br>\n  더 받지 않으려면 <a href=\"{{ unsubscribe_url }}\" style=\"color:#8b95a1;\">수신거부</a>를 눌러 주세요.</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>"}